<title>USA: Sysco to build Alabama distribution center.</title>
<headline>Sysco to build Alabama distribution center.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sysco Corp said on Monday its newly formed subsidiary Sysco Food Services of Central Alabama Inc will build a new distribution center in Calera, Ala., that will employ 325 people.</p>
<p>The 200,000-square-foot facility, expected to be operational by early 1998, will supply food and related products to restaurants and other clients in the Birmingham area, central and south Alabama and the Florida Panhandle.</p>
<p>Sysco is a food service marketing and distribution firm.</p>
</text>
